1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,898
Did you know your body can heal itself?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,524
Cut your finger, and within seconds,
platelets rush in to plug the leak.

3
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:14,152
Over the next few days, new skin cells
crawl across the gap, until it closes.

4
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:22,650
Break a bone, and your body builds a bridge
across the crack, then turns it back into solid bone.

5
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:25,781
Many breaks heal in about 6 to 8 weeks.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,850
Your liver can do something even stranger.

7
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:34,775
Surgeons can remove up to 2/3 of a healthy liver,
and it grows back.

8
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:42,863
Skin, bone, liver.
Every day, your body is quietly repairing itself.

9
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:47,330
That little scar? Proof that it works.
